# Overseas financial apps - explicitly routed through PROXY.
# Curated from official service documentation and publicly maintained app rule lists.
# Avoid blanket-routing shared analytics, wallet SDKs, KYC vendors or RPC providers:
# those domains may be used by unrelated apps and require device-log confirmation.

# Ethena: app and first-party API are subdomains of ethena.fi.
# Official API docs identify public.api.ethena.fi.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ethena.fi

# Plasma / Plasma One:
# official site + publicly documented app/service domains.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plasma.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plasma.to
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plasma-one.tech
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plasmascan.to

# ether.fi: first-party website/app and known app link/documentation hosts.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ether.fi
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,etherfi.gitbook.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,etherfi.onelink.me
